      "number": 14354,
      "title": "[css-scroll-snap-1] Support scroll snap for single-axis scroll containers #14018 ",
      "url": "https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/pull/14354",
      "author": "lcdavid94",
      "mergedAt": "2026-09-28T22:49:05Z",
      "hint": "unknown",
      "release": "⏳ 未リリース",
      "body": "[css-scroll-snap-1] Support scroll snap for single-axis scroll containers #14018\n\nClarify scroll snapping behavior when an intermediate container is a single-axis scroll container:\n- A single-axis scroll container only establishes snap positions in its scrollable axis; specifying `scroll-snap-type` in a non-scrollable axis has no effect.\n- Snap position capturing and snap container resolution are evaluated per-axis, allowing unconsumed snap axes to propagate to ancestor scroll containers.",
      "files": [
        "css-scroll-snap-1/Overview.bs (+15 -10)"
      ],
      "filesTotal": 1
    },
